  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 1340,
      "end_ms": 4490,
      "text": "原初物质和绝对精神本质上是同一个东西吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 4490,
      "end_ms": 7130,
      "text": "本质上是同一个东西吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 7130,
      "end_ms": 8930,
      "text": "和以及那个盒子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 8930,
      "end_ms": 9590,
      "text": "我跟你讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 9590,
      "end_ms": 11690,
      "text": "你这个问题里面都是不能说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 11690,
      "end_ms": 13250,
      "text": "你里面说的话都是非法的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 13250,
      "end_ms": 13790,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 13790,
      "end_ms": 15710,
      "text": "都代表你前反思"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 15710,
      "end_ms": 18230,
      "text": "你本质上是同一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 18230,
      "end_ms": 18830,
      "text": "我醉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 18830,
      "end_ms": 19580,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 19580,
      "end_ms": 21050,
      "text": "你你说的那些话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 21050,
      "end_ms": 27540,
      "text": "你凭什么说本质上是同一个是同一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 27919,
      "end_ms": 31999,
      "text": "然后还有一个和你知道这些东西都不配合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 31999,
      "end_ms": 36700,
      "text": "是和那个我们说的原初物质或者我们的问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 36700,
      "end_ms": 39739,
      "text": "意思说瞄准那个原初物质和绝对精神"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 42360,
      "end_ms": 43850,
      "text": "我这样简单来说吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 43850,
      "end_ms": 46190,
      "text": "这两个东西是TT0的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 46190,
      "end_ms": 48040,
      "text": "这两个东西是T0的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 48560,
      "end_ms": 50780,
      "text": "这个玩意是T1的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 50780,
      "end_ms": 52520,
      "text": "这个东西是T2的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 52520,
      "end_ms": 54050,
      "text": "这个东西是T3的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 54050,
      "end_ms": 57920,
      "text": "本质上这个东西可能是T呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 57920,
      "end_ms": 59240,
      "text": "1.5左右吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 59240,
      "end_ms": 62110,
      "text": "T1.5左右和这个东西也是T3的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 62110,
      "end_ms": 63610,
      "text": "你装配起来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 63610,
      "end_ms": 64930,
      "text": "这个你装配起来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 64930,
      "end_ms": 69840,
      "text": "这个就是说他在他在一个我所熟悉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 70500,
      "end_ms": 72920,
      "text": "他在一个我所熟悉的问题意识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 72920,
      "end_ms": 74960,
      "text": "和他的那个思想运动环节里面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 74960,
      "end_ms": 76580,
      "text": "你那个运动相当于什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 76580,
      "end_ms": 82200,
      "text": "你相当于在那个跳水运动当中举重举重"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 82200,
      "end_ms": 83640,
      "text": "举到一半又怎么样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 83640,
      "end_ms": 84660,
      "text": "拿了把枪出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 84660,
      "end_ms": 86820,
      "text": "对那个池子里面打了一枪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 86820,
      "end_ms": 87840,
      "text": "冒了个水花"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 87840,
      "end_ms": 89520,
      "text": "说表演完毕"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 89520,
      "end_ms": 91320,
      "text": "然后走下才爬下去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 91320,
      "end_ms": 93120,
      "text": "要要评委给你打分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 93120,
      "end_ms": 94370,
      "text": "就这种状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 94370,
      "end_ms": 96290,
      "text": "你听懂我的意思吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 96290,
      "end_ms": 97700,
      "text": "You can't do that"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 97700,
      "end_ms": 99650,
      "text": "这本质上是同一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 99650,
      "end_ms": 100590,
      "text": "同一线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 100590,
      "end_ms": 104190,
      "text": "首先当我们谈论原初物质的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 104190,
      "end_ms": 105930,
      "text": "或者谈论绝对精神的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 105930,
      "end_ms": 107930,
      "text": "同一线拜拜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 107930,
      "end_ms": 109500,
      "text": "先别讨论同一性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 109500,
      "end_ms": 113400,
      "text": "因为这里面还没有这个self自身性还没有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 113400,
      "end_ms": 114780,
      "text": "subject还没有的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 114780,
      "end_ms": 118129,
      "text": "他中间环节还没有的同一性东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 118129,
      "end_ms": 120409,
      "text": "在这里对象化的一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 120409,
      "end_ms": 121369,
      "text": "结构画了一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 121369,
      "end_ms": 122719,
      "text": "在这里也不配去讨论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 122719,
      "end_ms": 124140,
      "text": "你不能这样去讨论的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 124140,
      "end_ms": 125340,
      "text": "没有这种意向性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 125340,
      "end_ms": 127260,
      "text": "这个东西阶次太太低了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 127260,
      "end_ms": 127890,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 127890,
      "end_ms": 128880,
      "text": "太后面了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 128880,
      "end_ms": 130380,
      "text": "这个是派生的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 130399,
      "end_ms": 133279,
      "text": "也就是说他是不是同一个就不具有同一性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 133279,
      "end_ms": 135319,
      "text": "这个问题让你输出一下阶次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 135319,
      "end_ms": 137800,
      "text": "好歹那你这个问题是个T2的一个问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 137800,
      "end_ms": 139990,
      "text": "我给所有这些东西都降低"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 139990,
      "end_ms": 141300,
      "text": "但这个河又来了"
    }
